ok   data1 reads end of file when data is closed
ok   writing then fails with EPIPE
ok   #|/data opened alone has no other end
ok   an unknown device fails
#x: errno 2, errstr unknown device '#x/foo'
ok   errstr without a kernel message gives strerror
ok   errstr swaps the strings
